				<connector uid="7" polarity="+" isee:polarity_placement="outside" angle="357.917">
					<isee:documentation>Reasoning:
Higher baseline entry propensity stimulates firm creation.

Polarity Reasoning: 
Direct positive link.</isee:documentation>
					<isee:reasoning>Higher baseline entry propensity stimulates firm creation.</isee:reasoning>
