				<connector uid="9" polarity="+" isee:polarity_placement="outside" angle="8.97105">
					<isee:documentation>Reasoning:
Higher nominal willingness to modernize increases adoption speed.

Polarity Reasoning: 
Direct positive link.</isee:documentation>
					<isee:reasoning>Higher nominal willingness to modernize increases adoption speed.</isee:reasoning>
					<isee:polarity_reasoning>Direct positive link.</isee:polarity_reasoning>
					<from>base_adoption_rate</from>
