				</connector>
				<connector uid="22" polarity="+" isee:polarity_placement="outside" angle="6.13648">
					<isee:documentation>Reasoning:
Higher macro failure rate increases traditional firm closures.

Polarity Reasoning: 
Increases exits.</isee:documentation>
