				</connector>
				<connector uid="24" polarity="+" isee:polarity_placement="outside" angle="339.314">
					<isee:documentation>Reasoning:
Baseline exit rate governs business insolvency.

Polarity Reasoning: 
Increases exits.</isee:documentation>
