				<connector uid="1" polarity="+" isee:polarity_placement="outside" angle="355.543">
					<isee:documentation>Reasoning:
Available funding dictates how many projects can begin.

Polarity Reasoning: 
Higher funding directly increases starts.</isee:documentation>
					<isee:reasoning>Available funding dictates how many projects can begin.</isee:reasoning>
					<isee:polarity_reasoning>Higher funding directly increases starts.</isee:polarity_reasoning>
					<from>rd_project_funding_rate</from>
