				</connector>
				<connector uid="5" polarity="+" isee:polarity_placement="outside" angle="124.854">
					<isee:documentation>Reasoning:
Weight scales the impact of systems engineering on transfer efficacy.

Polarity Reasoning: 
Positive contribution to transfer efficacy.</isee:documentation>
