				</connector>
				<connector uid="11" polarity="-" isee:polarity_placement="outside" angle="349.696">
					<isee:documentation>Reasoning:
Bureaucratic and commercialization delays retard transfer speed.

Polarity Reasoning: 
Reduces transfer rate.</isee:documentation>
